items ({0,({"goolag","He steps forward to greet you with his katana and wakizashi in either hand.","ball","You are totally hypnotized by the ball... Hours later you wake up.","bartener","","bartender","He winks at you and serves you a beer.","bar","A huge bar covered totally clean of any trash.  What a good bartender.",}),0,0,({"bed","You jump into Slivantes bed and hope he does not come back in fear that he      would either kill you or seduce you.","clothes","You see a pile of old dirty clothes laying on the floor. ",}),({"feeder","A bird sits on the feeder and eats some of the seeds inside.","bird","You see a bird with a red back and a blue breast","chair","This is the lawn chair where Slivante sits to watch the sun rise and set",}),({"ocean","You see the waves gently roll up onto the shore","sun","You are witnessing the most beautiful sunset you have ever seen","blanket","A blanket is spread out on the sand",}),({"stereo","\"I want to be Bob Dillon and Mr. Jones wishes he someone just a little more      funk....\"  Plays out of the stereo.","tv","A new episode of X-men is playing on the television","individual","You notice the postal out fit and realize that it is Bill's brother Dave",}),({"hut","You think you could get in if only you had the key",}),0,})
